      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problem with this class is how a chesspiece moves\ndepands on the type of the piece and hence this class\nis violating srp. \n\nhow move gonna look like in this class structure\nif (this.name == 'R') {do something} \nelse if () {do something}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem with this class is how a chesspiece moves\ndepands on the type of the piece and hence this class\nis violating srp. \n\nhow move gonna look like in this class structure\nif (this.name == 'R') {do something} \nelse if () {do something}\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
