    {
      "id": "h5sIBmapXXQcX6KH8hBDL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 658.199951171875,
      "y": 3020,
      "width": 409.2197570800781,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 167225876,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 17498796,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778932103445,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In a new world of chess\n\n- Rook --> Rook + knight \n- Queen --> Queen + knight\n- Knight --> Bishop + king\n- King --> Pawn + Rook + Queen + Bishop \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In a new world of chess\n\n- Rook --> Rook + knight \n- Queen --> Queen + knight\n- Knight --> Bishop + king\n- King --> Pawn + Rook + Queen + Bishop \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qtRhC5vv6o1VqmjZSdEIa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 655.9999389648438,
      "y": 3191.2000122070312,
      "width": 439.2996520996094,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 940851860,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 98669716,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778932992498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This violates Interface Segregation Principle",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This violates Interface Segregation Principle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1QAanPoe7WFOvWG-Bpqo5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 415.199951171875,
      "y": 3228.6000061035156,
      "width": 1055.539306640625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 994614828,
      "version": 627,
      "versionNonce": 780374444,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778933189495,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n- The ISP is a software engineering principle that states that code should not be\nforced to use the method that it doesn't need.\n- It states that if any particular child isn't intended to be having a particular behavior of the parent, then\nit should not be forced to have that behavior. \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n- The ISP is a software engineering principle that states that code should not be\nforced to use the method that it doesn't need.\n- It states that if any particular child isn't intended to be having a particular behavior of the parent, then\nit should not be forced to have that behavior. \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
